tiers.basic:
{
  "tier": "basic",
  "challenges": [
    {
      "slug": "css-selector-101-id-class",
      "type": "CSS_SELECTOR",
      "difficulty": "EASY",
      "category": "css-basics",
      "xpReward": 10,
      "order": 1000,
      "title": {
        "en": "Read an ID Selector",
        "id": "Baca ID Selector"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Read CSS ID and class syntax without assuming those attributes are stable test contracts.",
        "id": "Baca syntax CSS ID dan class tanpa menganggap atribut itu otomatis menjadi test contract yang stabil."
      },
      "instructions": {
        "en": "# Read an ID Selector\n\n## Scenario\nThis controlled login fixture gives its button the ID `login-btn`. In CSS, `#name` selects an element by ID, while `.name` selects elements containing a class token.\n\nAn ID can be useful implementation evidence, but uniqueness does not guarantee maintainability. In a real Playwright test, first ask whether a user-facing locator or a deliberately supported test ID expresses the intent better.\n\n## Your task\nWrite the CSS selector that targets the element whose ID is `login-btn`.",
        "id": "# Baca ID Selector\n\n## Skenario\nControlled login fixture ini memberi button ID `login-btn`. Dalam CSS, `#nama` memilih elemen berdasarkan ID, sedangkan `.nama` memilih elemen yang memiliki class token tersebut.\n\nID bisa menjadi implementation evidence yang berguna, tapi unique belum tentu maintainable. Dalam test Playwright nyata, cek dulu apakah user-facing locator atau supported test ID bisa menyatakan intent dengan lebih baik.\n\n## Tugas kamu\nTulis CSS selector yang menargetkan elemen dengan ID `login-btn`."
      },
      "hints": {
        "en": [
          "The fixture exposes the exact ID `login-btn`.",
          "CSS ID selectors begin with `#`.",
          "The expected selector is `#login-btn`."
        ],
        "id": [
          "Fixture menyediakan exact ID `login-btn`.",
          "CSS ID selector diawali dengan `#`.",
          "Selector yang diharapkan adalah `#login-btn`."
        ]
      },
      "htmlContent": "<div class=\"login-wrapper\">\n  <h1>System Login</h1>\n  <form class=\"login-form\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"username\" placeholder=\"Username\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"input-group\">\n      <input type=\"password\" id=\"password\" placeholder=\"Password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <button type=\"submit\" id=\"login-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Login</button>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"forgot-link\">Forgot Password?</a>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</div>",
      "starterCode": "",
      "testCases": [
        {
          "description": "Selects the target element",
          "expectedOutput": {
            "selector": "#login-btn",
            "matchCount": 1
          },
          "isHidden": false
        }
      ],
      "solution": "#login-btn",
      "tags": ["beginner", "css", "basics", "id", "class"]
    },
    {
      "slug": "css-tag-selectors",
      "type": "CSS_SELECTOR",
      "difficulty": "EASY",
      "category": "css-basics",
      "xpReward": 10,
      "order": 1001,
      "title": {
        "en": "Inspect a Tag Collection",
        "id": "Periksa Collection Berdasarkan Tag"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Use a broad tag selector when the element type itself is the controlled exercise.",
        "id": "Gunakan broad tag selector saat tipe elemen memang menjadi fokus controlled exercise."
      },
      "instructions": {
        "en": "# Inspect a Tag Collection\n\n## Scenario\nA tag selector such as `p`, `a`, or `button` describes every matching element type inside the current scope. It is usually too broad to identify one business control, but it can be useful when inspecting a collection or learning the fixture.\n\nThis controlled card contains exactly one paragraph. The exercise intentionally asks for the broad tag, not a production locator recommendation.\n\n## Your task\nWrite the CSS tag selector that selects the paragraph element.",
        "id": "# Periksa Collection Berdasarkan Tag\n\n## Skenario\nTag selector seperti `p`, `a`, atau `button` menjelaskan semua tipe elemen yang cocok di dalam scope. Biasanya selector ini terlalu luas untuk mengenali satu business control, tapi bisa berguna saat memeriksa collection atau membaca fixture.\n\nControlled card ini hanya memiliki satu paragraph. Latihan memang meminta broad tag, bukan merekomendasikannya sebagai production locator.\n\n## Tugas kamu\nTulis CSS tag selector yang memilih elemen paragraph."
      },
      "hints": {
        "en": [
          "The target element is a paragraph.",
          "A tag selector uses the raw HTML tag without a prefix.",
          "Use `p`."
        ],
        "id": [
          "Target-nya adalah elemen paragraph.",
          "Tag selector memakai raw HTML tag tanpa prefix.",
          "Gunakan `p`."
        ]
      },
      "htmlContent": "<div class=\"welcome-card\">\n  <h2>Welcome Aboard</h2>\n  <p>Thank you for joining our platform. We are excited to see what you build!</p>\n  <button class=\"btn\">Get Started</button>\n</div>",
      "starterCode": "",
      "testCases": [
        {
          "description": "Selects the target element",
          "expectedOutput": {
            "selector": "p",
            "matchCount": 1
          },
          "isHidden": false
        }
      ],
      "solution": "p",
      "tags": ["beginner", "css", "basics", "tag"]
    },
    {
      "slug": "css-combining-basics",
      "type": "CSS_SELECTOR",
      "difficulty": "EASY",
      "category": "css-basics",
      "xpReward": 20,
      "order": 1002,
      "title": {
