        "en": "# Combine XPath Conditions\n\nXPath predicates can combine clauses with `and`, `or`, and `not()`. This fixture asks for a `button` whose `type` is `submit` and whose class string contains `primary`.\n\nMore conditions can reduce matches, but precision and maintainability are different. A styling-class change can still break the result, and substring class matching can still overmatch.\n\n## Your task\nWrite the XPath that combines the exact submit type and the class substring `primary`.",
        "id": "# Gabungkan XPath Condition\n\nXPath predicate bisa menggabungkan clause dengan `and`, `or`, dan `not()`. Fixture ini meminta `button` yang `type`-nya `submit` dan class string-nya mengandung `primary`.\n\nLebih banyak condition bisa mengurangi match, tapi precision dan maintainability adalah hal berbeda. Perubahan styling class tetap bisa mematahkan hasil, dan substring class matching tetap bisa overmatch.\n\n## Tugas kamu\nTulis XPath yang menggabungkan exact submit type dan class substring `primary`."
      },
