        "en": "# Normalize Whitespace in Legacy XPath\n\n`normalize-space()` removes leading and trailing whitespace and collapses whitespace runs to one space. It can make a legacy text expression tolerate formatting-only differences.\n\nIt does not protect a locator from changed wording, nested structure, localization, or the wrong element role. For new Playwright tests, prefer the locator contract that best expresses the scenario.\n\n## Your task\nWrite the XPath for a `button` whose normalized string value is `Save Changes`.",
        "id": "# Normalize Whitespace dalam Legacy XPath\n\n`normalize-space()` menghapus leading dan trailing whitespace lalu merapatkan rangkaian whitespace menjadi satu spasi. Function ini bisa membuat legacy text expression menoleransi perbedaan formatting saja.\n\nFunction ini nggak melindungi locator dari perubahan wording, nested structure, localization, atau role yang salah. Untuk test Playwright baru, pilih locator contract yang paling sesuai dengan skenario.\n\n## Tugas kamu\nTulis XPath untuk `button` yang normalized string value-nya adalah `Save Changes`."
