      },
      "instructions": {
        "en": "# XPath Axes: Preceding & Following\n\n## Concept\nAxes let you jump comfortably anywhere in the document flow, ignoring nesting.\n\n## Code Example\n```xpath\n//h3[text()=\"Title\"]/following::button[1]\n//div[@id=\"footer\"]/preceding::input[1]\n```\n\n## Real World Scenario\nSometimes the HTML structure is flat (lots of divs) rather than nested. You might see a Header \"Product A\", and the \"Edit\" button is just... later in the file. The `following::` axis lets you skip over all the structure and just say \"Find me the next button.\"\n\n## Your Task\n1.  Find the header `h3` with text \"Product A\".\n2.  Use `following::button[1]` to find the very first button that appears after that header in the document flow.\n",
        "id": "# Sumbu (Axes) XPath: Preceding & Following\n\n## Konsep\nAxes memungkinkan kamu melompat dengan nyaman ke mana saja dalam alur dokumen, mengabaikan nesting.\n\n## Contoh Kode\n```xpath\n//h3[text()=\"Title\"]/following::button[1]\n//div[@id=\"footer\"]/preceding::input[1]\n```\n\n## Skenario Dunia Nyata\nTerkadang struktur HTML datar. Kamu mungkin melihat Header \"Produk A\", dan tombol \"Edit\" ada di bawahnya. `following::` membantumu melompati struktur dan menemukan \"tombol berikutnya\".\n\n## Tugas Kamu\n1. Temukan header `h3` dengan teks \"Product A\".\n2. Gunakan `following::button[1]` untuk menemukan tombol pertama yang muncul setelah header itu.\n"
      },
      "hints": {
        "en": [
          "Jump to elements anywhere in the document that appear after your current anchor, even if they aren't directly related or nested.",
          "The 'following::' axis creates a flat list of all nodes that come after your starting point.",
          "Start from the 'Product A' header, then jump to the first button that follows it: '//h3[text()=\"Product A\"]/following::button[1]'."
        ],
        "id": [
          "Lompat ke elemen mana pun di dokumen yang muncul setelah jangkar Kamu saat ini, meskipun elemen tersebut tidak terkait langsung atau bersarang.",
          "Sumbu 'following::' membuat daftar datar dari semua node yang muncul setelah titik awal Kamu.",
          "Mulai dari header 'Product A', lalu lompat ke tombol pertama yang mengikutinya: '//h3[text()=\"Product A\"]/following::button[1]'."
        ]
      },
      "htmlContent": "<div class=\"product-list\">\n  <div class=\"header-section\">\n    <h3>Product A</h3>\n    <span class=\"badge\">New</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"details-section\">\n    <p>Price: $10</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"actions-section\">\n    <button class=\"btn\">View</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\">Edit</button>\n  </div>\n  \n  <hr>\n\n  <div class=\"header-section\">\n    <h3>Product B</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"actions-section\">\n    <button class=\"btn\">View</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\">Edit</button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
      "starterCode": "",
