      "instructions": {
        "en": "# Registration Follows Validation State\n\nThis standalone registration form starts with an invalid email and an empty password. Its business rule is observable in two states: invalid data shows guidance and blocks registration; valid data clears the guidance and makes registration available.\n\nChoose the smallest sufficient evidence for that transition. You do not need to verify every piece of markup on the page.\n\n## Your Task\n1. Locate the email guidance by `alert` role and **Register** by button role.\n2. Prove the guidance is visible with the exact text `Invalid email format`.\n3. Prove Register starts disabled.\n4. Fill **Email** with `user@example.com` and **Password** with `password123` by label.\n5. Prove the email guidance becomes hidden and Register becomes enabled.\n",
        "id": "# Validasi State Registrasi\n\nStandalone registration form ini dimulai dengan invalid email dan password kosong. Business rule-nya terlihat dalam dua state: invalid data menampilkan guidance dan memblokir registration; valid data menghapus guidance lalu membuat registration tersedia.\n\nPilih evidence paling kecil yang sudah cukup untuk membuktikan transition itu. Kamu nggak perlu memverifikasi setiap markup yang ada di page.\n\n## Tugas Kamu\n1. Cari email guidance berdasarkan role `alert` dan **Register** berdasarkan button role.\n2. Buktikan guidance terlihat dengan exact text `Invalid email format`.\n3. Buktikan Register dimulai dalam disabled state.\n4. Isi **Email** dengan `user@example.com` dan **Password** dengan `password123` berdasarkan label.\n5. Buktikan email guidance menjadi hidden dan Register menjadi enabled.\n"
      },
