        "en": "# Wait for the Outcome, Not the Clock\n\nThis standalone page changes its status from `Not saved` to `Saving…` and then asynchronously to `Profile saved`. A successful button click proves only that the action was possible. Prove the product outcome with a retried text assertion on the status region.\n\n## Your Task\n1. Click **Save profile** by role and accessible name.\n2. Verify the status eventually has the exact text `Profile saved`.\n3. Do not use `waitForTimeout()`; wait for the observable condition, not elapsed time.\n",
